(The HX units use R-290 \(propane\), a flammable refrigerant. Only installers with the flammable) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(refrigerant certificate may open the refrigerant circuit. Keep a safety zone of 2.0 m around the) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(unit free of ignition sources, drains, light wells and air intakes. Never install the unit in a pit) Tj T*
/F1 9 Tf
(or below ground level.) Tj T*
